<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Craft the Tissue Grinder and Genome Extractor Table to create genoframes and genomes respectively.-->
  <GR_GeneticAlteration.description>制作组织研磨机和基因组提取器表以分别创建基因框和基因组。</GR_GeneticAlteration.description>
  <GR_GeneticAlteration.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->unveiling genetic fabrics-->
    <li>subject-&gt;揭开遗传结构的面纱</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->embarked on the journey to manipulate the very blueprint of life, crafting tools to unravel and reweave genetic threads-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;踏上了操纵生命蓝图的旅程，制作工具来解开和重新编织遗传线索</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created the Tissue Grinder and Genome Extractor Table, key instruments in the quest to understand and harness genetic potential-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创建了组织研磨机和基因组提取表，这是探索和利用遗传潜力的关键工具</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->laying the groundwork for a future where biology meets creativity-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;为生物学与创造力相遇的未来奠定基础</li>
  </GR_GeneticAlteration.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: genetic alteration-->
  <GR_GeneticAlteration.label>基因改变</GR_GeneticAlteration.label>
  <!--EN: Grow bio-engineered implants for humans on the Implant augmentator.-->
  <GR_GeneticCompatibility.description>在植入增强器上为人类种植生物工程植入物。</GR_GeneticCompatibility.description>
  <GR_GeneticCompatibility.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->bridging genomes-->
    <li>subject-&gt;桥接基因组</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->extended the boundaries of bio-engineering to humans, ensuring compatibility between their biology and the myriad forms of life-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将生物工程的边界扩展到人类，确保其生物学与无数生命形式之间的兼容性</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->focused on the harmony of existence, where human potential can be expanded through genetic synergy-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;注重存在的和谐，通过基因协同作用可以扩展人类的潜力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->harmonizing human essence with the genetic chorus of the cosmos-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;使人类本质与宇宙的基因合唱相协调</li>
  </GR_GeneticCompatibility.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: genetic compatibility-->
  <GR_GeneticCompatibility.label>遗传相容性</GR_GeneticCompatibility.label>
  <!--EN: Manufacture Template Genomes through the Genome Recombinator and duplicate existing Genomes.-->
  <GR_GeneticDuplication.description>通过基因组重组器制造模板基因组并复制现有基因组。</GR_GeneticDuplication.description>
  <GR_GeneticDuplication.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->mirroring life-->
    <li>subject-&gt;镜像生活</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->mastered the art of genomic replication, ensuring valuable genetic traits can be preserved and replicated-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;掌握了基因组复制的艺术，确保有价值的遗传性状得以保存和复制</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated with the Genome Recombinator, a breakthrough in the efficient duplication of genetic material-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;基因组重组器的创新，遗传物质高效复制的突破</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->duplicating the essence of life for prosperity and progress-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;复制生命的本质以实现繁荣和进步</li>
  </GR_GeneticDuplication.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: genetic duplication-->
  <GR_GeneticDuplication.label>基因重复</GR_GeneticDuplication.label>
  <!--EN: Create new hybrids with the Genomorpher, gestate them in an Electrowomb and create boosters at the Genetics Tinkering Table.-->
  <GR_GeneticEngineering.description>使用 Genomorpher 创建新的杂交体，在电子宫中孕育它们，并在遗传学修补台上创建助推器。</GR_GeneticEngineering.description>
  <GR_GeneticEngineering.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the architects of life-->
    <li>subject-&gt;生活的建筑师</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->transcended traditional breeding, employing the Genomorpher to forge new forms of life-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;超越传统育种，利用基因形态创造新的生命形式</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ushered in the age of the Electrowomb, where gestation becomes a process guided by precision and intent-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;迎来了电子宫时代，妊娠成为一个由精确和意图引导的过程</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->sculpting the living world with visionary hands-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;用富有远见的双手塑造生活世界</li>
  </GR_GeneticEngineering.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: genetic creation-->
  <GR_GeneticEngineering.label>基因创造</GR_GeneticEngineering.label>
  <!--EN: Create Biomechanical Lab beacons to find mechahybridizers, and construct mechahybrid antennas to support more mechanoid hybrids.-->
  <GR_GeneticMechahybridization.description>创建生物力学实验室信标来寻找机械混合器，并构建机械混合天线以支持更多机械混合体。</GR_GeneticMechahybridization.description>
  <GR_GeneticMechahybridization.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the synthesis of organic and machine-->
    <li>subject-&gt;有机合成与机械</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ventured into uncharted territories, blending organic life with mechanoid essence to birth new forms of existence-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;冒险进入未知领域，将有机生命与机械本质相融合，诞生新的存在形式</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->established the Biomechanical Lab, a beacon for those who dare to redefine life's boundaries-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;建立了生物力学实验室，为那些敢于重新定义生命界限的人树立了灯塔</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->forging the future with strands of DNA and circuits entwined-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;通过 DNA 链和电路交织打造未来</li>
  </GR_GeneticMechahybridization.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: genetic mechahybridization-->
  <GR_GeneticMechahybridization.label>遗传机械杂交</GR_GeneticMechahybridization.label>
  <!--EN: Grow bio-engineered implants for hybrids and animals alike on the Implant augmentator.-->
  <GR_HybridImplantology.description>在植入物增强器上为杂交种和动物培育生物工程植入物。</GR_HybridImplantology.description>
  <GR_HybridImplantology.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->fusing flesh and innovation-->
    <li>subject-&gt;融合肉体与创新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered the growth of bio-engineered implants, merging organic life with enhancements-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开创了生物工程植入物的生长，将有机生命与增强功能融为一体</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->explored the possibilities of augmentation, not just for survival but for the evolution of abilities-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;探索增强的可能性，不仅是为了生存，也是为了能力的进化</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->cultivating the next step in organismal advancement-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;培养有机体进步的下一步</li>
  </GR_HybridImplantology.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: genetic augmentation-->
  <GR_HybridImplantology.label>基因增强</GR_HybridImplantology.label>
</LanguageData>
